1. Tính theo credit

input: 80,000 / 1M * price/1M = 80,000 / 1M * 0.25 = 0.02
output: 150,000 / 1M * price/1M = 150,000 / 1M * 2 = 0.3

1 credits = 500,000 tokens
token_used = input + [output * (price_out/price_in/2)] = 680000
credit_used = token_used / 500000 = 1.36 = 0.32$ * 27000 = 8640
+ cost_storage_file (0.015$)
+ cost_database (0.09$)
+ cost_dev (0.9$)
= 8640 + 405 + 2430 + 24300 = 35775

==> 1.36 credit = 35775 VND
==> 1 credit = 1$ (27000)
==> Nạp vào tối thiểu 4 credit

